<h2>Creating a New Lead</h2>

<p>
    Adding a new lead is quick and easy:
</p>

<ol>
    <li>Click the <strong>"New Lead"</strong> button</li>
    <li>Fill in the basic information:
        <ul>
            <li>Company name</li>
            <li>Contact person</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Phone number</li>
            <li>Any initial notes</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Save the lead</li>
</ol>

<p>
    The new lead will appear in the "New" stage (or whatever your first stage is). You can add more details later as you learn more about the opportunity.
</p>

